  "howTo": {
   "goal": "Be the first to reach <b>10 victory points</b> on your own turn. Settlements are worth 1, cities 2, plus bonus cards and awards.",
   "turn": [
    [
     "🏠",
     "Start: place 2 settlements",
     "Everyone places a settlement and a road, twice (the order snakes back). Your second settlement gives you its neighbouring resources."
    ],
    [
     "🎲",
     "Roll the dice",
     "Every tile showing that number produces: each settlement on its corner gets 1 card, each city 2. Red 6s and 8s roll most often."
    ],
    [
     "🔨",
     "Build",
     "<b>Road</b> lumber + brick · <b>Settlement</b> lumber + brick + wool + grain (at least 2 roads apart from any building) · <b>City</b> upgrade 2 grain + 3 ore · <b>Development card</b> wool + grain + ore."
    ],
    [
     "🤝",
     "Trade",
     "With the bank 4 : 1, or 3 : 1 / 2 : 1 at a harbor you have built on. Or post an offer to the other players."
    ],
    [
     "⏭️",
     "End your turn",
     "Tap End turn. If a turn timer is on, your turn ends by itself when it runs out."
    ]
   ],
   "tips": [
    "<b>Rolled a 7?</b> Anyone holding more than 7 cards discards half. The roller moves the hooded robber to a tile (it stops producing) and steals a card from someone there.",
    "<b>Development cards:</b> Knight (move the robber), Road Building, Year of Plenty, Monopoly, or a hidden Victory Point. Play one per turn, not on the turn you bought it.",
    "<b>Longest Road</b> (5+ connected roads) and <b>Largest Army</b> (3+ knights) are each worth 2 points.",
    "Spread your settlements over different resources and numbers so you collect cards on many rolls."
   ]
  },
  "bot": true,
  "onTimeout": true,
  "defaultTimer": 30,
  "simultaneous": false,
